three of which were prominent enough to make

00:00:24.039 --> 00:00:25.360
national news.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:31.630
But a total of 10 different mass shootings,
some particularly horrible.

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:38.180
And it is yet another reminder of this completely
out of control gun violence problem that exists

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:39.180
