00:01:10.889 --> 00:01:14.170
South Carolina didn't just have one Easter
mass shooting.

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:21.179
They had two Easter mass shootings in Pittsburgh,
two teenage boys killed and eight others wounded

00:01:21.179 --> 00:01:27.909
after gunfire erupted at a party in a short
term rental home in Pittsburgh early Sunday.

00:01:27.909 --> 00:01:33.100
The other two shootings, both in South Carolina,
